1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,266
Welcome to your English reading comprehension lesson. Today, we'll explore shopping places, fashion designers, and personal clothing styles.

2
00:00:10,266 --> 00:00:26,072
Books and Company is an interesting bookshop, open 9 am to 6 pm. They sell old and new books, magazines, pictures, old photographs, and music. If you like old books and pictures, this is the place for you.

3
00:00:26,072 --> 00:00:40,625
The Saturday Market is open 6 am to 4 pm. Here you can buy something for your home or just look around. They sell many old things: clocks, radios, suitcases, lamps, pictures, chairs, and more!

4
00:00:40,625 --> 00:00:57,186
The Mega Home Store is open 8 am to 8 pm. It's a great place to buy new, inexpensive things for your home like beds, pillows, tables, chairs, and lamps. There’s also a good café with drinks, pizzas, and sandwiches.

5
00:00:57,186 --> 00:01:06,438
Which place is good for someone who wants a new bed for their flat?

6
00:01:06,438 --> 00:01:09,619
The Mega Home Store sells new beds.

7
00:01:09,619 --> 00:01:19,313
Which place is good for someone who loves old books and magazines?

8
00:01:19,313 --> 00:01:23,631
Books and Company sells old books and magazines.

9
00:01:23,631 --> 00:01:34,079
Which place is good for someone who always finishes work at 7:00 pm?

10
00:01:34,079 --> 00:01:37,702
The Mega Home Store is open until 8 pm.

11
00:01:37,702 --> 00:01:46,605
Which place is good for someone who thinks old lamps are beautiful?

12
00:01:46,605 --> 00:01:51,667
The Saturday Market sells lots of old things, including lamps.

13
00:01:51,667 --> 00:02:03,268
Fashion designers often make very different, interesting clothes for people. But sometimes they wear boring clothes, often the same clothes and colors themselves.

14
00:02:03,268 --> 00:02:11,909
Tom Ford makes beautiful clothes for men and women. However, he often wears a white shirt and a black or dark grey jacket.

15
00:02:11,909 --> 00:02:20,039
Carolina Herrera makes clothes with lots of different colours. But she usually wears a black skirt and a white shirt.

16
00:02:20,039 --> 00:02:29,747
Alexander Wang is a young designer with unusual ideas. However, he usually wears a white T-shirt, black jeans, and a black jacket.

17
00:02:29,747 --> 00:02:39,768
Fashion designers sometimes wear boring clothes. True or False?

18
00:02:39,768 --> 00:02:44,183
That's true. They sometimes wear boring clothes.

19
00:02:44,183 --> 00:02:53,194
Tom Ford never wears a black jacket. True or False?

20
00:02:53,194 --> 00:02:57,120
That's false. He often wears a black jacket.

21
00:02:57,120 --> 00:03:06,863
Carolina Herrera often wears a white skirt. True or False?

22
00:03:06,863 --> 00:03:11,138
That's false. She usually wears a black skirt.

23
00:03:11,138 --> 00:03:20,892
Alexander Wang usually wears a jacket. True or False?

24
00:03:20,892 --> 00:03:25,376
That's true. He usually wears a black jacket.

25
00:03:25,376 --> 00:03:36,884
Pete is a police officer and wears a dark blue uniform: jacket, trousers, and a white shirt. They also have big yellow police jackets to wear when they’re outside in the street.

26
00:03:36,884 --> 00:03:46,186
These yellow jackets are very useful because people can easily see that they are police officers. Pete doesn’t have to worry about his work clothes.

27
00:03:46,186 --> 00:03:55,848
Pete isn't very interested in fashion. His wife, Jane, says his clothes are boring, but most of his friends’ clothes are the same as his!

28
00:03:55,848 --> 00:04:06,834
When not at work, Pete likes to wear comfortable clothes, for example, jeans and a T-shirt or a jumper. His favourite item of clothing is his old brown jacket.

29
00:04:06,834 --> 00:04:14,067
Pete doesn’t really have a favourite colour, but he tries not to wear dark blue because it’s the colour of his uniform.

30
00:04:14,067 --> 00:04:25,076
He doesn’t have many expensive clothes, but for special events, like friends' weddings, he needs something nice. He has a suit by the designer Tom Ford.

31
00:04:25,076 --> 00:04:36,064
His suit has dark grey trousers and a matching jacket. He usually wears this with a white shirt and tie. Pete usually goes shopping with Jane at the shopping mall.

32
00:04:36,064 --> 00:04:48,411
His favourite shop there is Marks and Spencer. Their clothes are usually comfortable and not very expensive. He buys all his clothes there, but Jane’s favourite shops are Next and Debenhams.

33
00:04:48,411 --> 00:04:56,516
Pete’s uniform is blue. True or False?

34
00:04:56,516 --> 00:05:00,350
That's true. His uniform is dark blue.

35
00:05:00,350 --> 00:05:09,860
The police officers’ yellow jackets are useful. True or False?

36
00:05:09,860 --> 00:05:14,228
That's true. They are useful because people can see them.

37
00:05:14,228 --> 00:05:23,170
Pete’s friends like fashionable clothes. True or False?

38
00:05:23,170 --> 00:05:29,999
That's false. Most of his friends' clothes are the same as his, which Jane calls boring.

39
00:05:29,999 --> 00:05:38,395
His favourite colour is brown. True or False?

40
00:05:38,395 --> 00:05:45,038
That's false. His favourite item is a brown jacket, but he doesn't have a favourite colour.

41
00:05:45,038 --> 00:05:54,479
He has an expensive suit for special events. True or False?

42
00:05:54,479 --> 00:05:58,719
That's true. He has a suit by designer Tom Ford.

43
00:05:58,719 --> 00:06:08,589
He usually wears a dark grey shirt for special events. True or False?

44
00:06:08,589 --> 00:06:13,503
That's false. He wears a white shirt and tie with his suit.

45
00:06:13,503 --> 00:06:22,502
Marks and Spencer is in the shopping mall. True or False?

46
00:06:22,502 --> 00:06:28,669
That's true. He goes to the shopping mall and his favourite shop there is Marks and Spencer.

47
00:06:28,669 --> 00:06:37,924
Jane’s favourite shop is the same as Pete’s. True or False?

48
00:06:37,924 --> 00:06:44,812
That's false. Pete's favourite is Marks and Spencer, but Jane's are Next and Debenhams.

49
00:06:44,812 --> 00:06:51,423
Great job! You've completed the reading comprehension exercises. Keep practicing!
